rac{∂}{∂x}({e}^{{x}^{2}y}-y\\operatorname{ln}⁡x) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({e}^{{x}^{2}y})-\\frac{∂}{∂x}(y\\operatorname{ln}⁡x)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we use the chain and constant multiple rules:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂}{∂x}({e}^{{x}^{2}y})-\\frac{∂}{∂x}(y\\operatorname{ln}⁡x) & ={e}^{{x}^{2}y}\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{2}y)-\\frac{∂}{∂x}(y\\operatorname{ln}⁡x) \\\\  & ={e}^{{x}^{2}y}\\cdot y\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{2})-y\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡x) \\\\  & ={e}^{{x}^{2}y}\\cdot y\\cdot 2x-y\\cdot \\frac{1}{x} \\\\  & =2xy{e}^{{x}^{2}y}-\\frac{y}{x}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534923 true] [17592186320200 1000 #edb/ref 17592186320201 13194139534923 true] [17592186320200 1000 #edb/ref 17592186320202 13194139534923 true] [17592186320200 1000 #edb/ref 17592186320203 13194139534923 true] [17592186320200 1000 #edb/ref 17592186320204 13194139534923 true] [17592186320200 1000 #edb/ref 17592186320205 13194139534923 true] [17592186320200 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534923 true] [17592186320200 1041 "selection" 13194139534923 true] [17592186320200 1104 #edb/ref 17592186320202 13194139534923 true] [17592186320200 1110 #uuid "a355a4ea-1b10-5d8e-a146-28a6f0966803" 13194139534923 true] [17592186320201 1034 "{e}^{{x}^{2}y}-\\frac{y}{x}" 13194139534923 true] [17592186320201 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534923 true] [17592186320201 1111 #uuid "5e287542-a75c-5c22-bbb5-c406a76e87b9" 13194139534923 true] [17592186320202 1034 "2xy{e}^{{x}^{2}y}-\\frac{y}{x}" 13194139534923 true] [17592186320202 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534923 true] [17592186320202 1111 #uuid "11caa765-db5e-562d-8949-2d15235e8758" 13194139534923 true] [17592186320203 1034 "2y{e}^{{x}^{2}y}-\\frac{1}{x}" 13194139534923 true] [17592186320203 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534923 true] [17592186320203 1111 #uuid "b8d05e49-de30-5a20-9b84-75fa8d64a8f8" 13194139534923 true] [17592186320204 1034 "xy{e}^{{x}^{2}y}-\\frac{2y}{x}" 13194139534923 true] [17592186320204 1103 #e